  "starterCode": "# Decoder Block — reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(x, attention_output, ffn_output):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Decoder Block** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(x, attention_output, ffn_output):\n    # Simplified precomputed-submodule contract: residual attention, then residual FFN.\n    x=np.asarray(x,dtype=float)\n    a=np.asarray(attention_output,dtype=float)\n    f=np.asarray(ffn_output,dtype=float)\n    return (x+a+f).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
